WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.225
The universe was very hot and dense, and has expanded and cooled ever since.

2
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:11.127
Thirteen point eight billion years ago, the universe was extremely hot and dense.

3
00:00:16.301 --> 00:00:20.176
As it expanded it cooled, forming first nuclei, then atoms.

4
00:00:25.301 --> 00:00:30.201
Then came stars and galaxies; heavier elements were made inside stars.
